get_live_fx_rates: description, inputSchema, outputSchema  -must price an amount of EUR, GBP, JPY, AUD, MXN, BRL, CAD, SGD, ZAR +needs on-chain EUR/GBP/MXN/BRL/CAD/SGD/ZAR/IDR vs USD -IDR in USD now, +exchange quotes for 8 pairs, -at the ECB fix. +ECB. -live +on-chain FX bid/ask/mid with ECB deviation_pct; -FX rates from on-chain stablecoin pools on Base (EUR, GBP, MXN, BRL, CAD, SGD, ZAR, IDR per USD); shallow pools go under `thin`, never as a rate. Also indicative bid, ask and mid for EURUSD, GBPUSD, USDJPY and AUDUSD +quotes -(`exchange_quotes`, with age_s). Indicative on-chain prices, +for EURUSD, GBPUSD, USDJPY, AUDUSD, USDCAD, USDCHF, EURGBP, EU  parameters: -pair; USDJPY +pair. Exchange quotes cover EURUSD, GBPUSD, USDJPY, AUDUSD, USDCAD, USDCHF, EURGBP -AUDUSD return indicative exchange quotes only. +EURJPY. USDJPY, AUDUSD, USDCHF, EURGBP and EURJPY are exchange-only; EURUSD, GBPUSD and USDCAD also have configured on-chain pools. +output.exchange_gaps output.exchange_gaps.exchange_age_s output.exchange_gaps.exchange_as_of output.exchange_gaps.exchange_mid output.exchange_gaps.exchange_stale output.exchange_gaps.gap_pct output.exchange_gaps.gap_pct description: (onchain_mid / exchange_mid - 1) * 100; not synchronized. output.exchange_gaps.onchain
sec_financials: description, outputSchema  -per fiscal year +annual -quarter +quarterly -gross profit, operating and net -assets, liabilities, equity, cash, operating +balance sheet, -shares, each +shares -the -used, form, period -accession; +filing; +Latest comparable filed fact wins (/A, accession, tag ties); newer excluded concepts/start dates warn in selection.  parameters: +output.periods.selection output.periods.selection description: Selection within the priority-anchored category, exact start/end and unit. Only Revenues / RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax and basic or diluted EPS / combined EPS are cross-tag economic aliases. Any observed filing reporting both revenue tags for the same dates with different values marks them as different scopes for that filer; absent scope evidence also disables that alias. Latest filed date wins; equal dates prefer /A forms, then greatest accession as a deterministic tie-break (not filing order), then tag pr
treasury_yield_curve: description  -domain), cached up to +domain); eligible for refresh after +a copy fetched within 24 hours may be stale: true with its published date;

